<title>USA: Dynamic Homes Inc Q1 March 31 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Homes Inc Q1 March 31 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT LAKES, Minn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p>Operating Revenues:</p>
<p>   Single-Family Housing	   $ 1,302,000	 $  993,000</p>
<p>   Multi-Family/Commercial	     239,000		   --</p>
<p>   Transportation			   92,000	     67,000</p>
<p>   Other					59,000	     49,000</p>
<p>   Shagawa Resort			   56,000		   --</p>
