<p>NOTE: Higher 1997 Q1 sales due to deliveries of single-family units that had been delayed by winter weather since the fourth quarter of 1996. Higher 1997 Q1 net loss due to decline in the gross margin, reflecting, in part, impact of promotional discounts during the seasonally slow winter months. In addition, Shagawa Resort, a Holiday Inn Sunspree Motel, increased the first quarter loss by less than $.01 per share.</p>
